---
layout: base.njk
title: Devlog
permalink: /devlog/
pageClass: devlog
description: Development updates from LivingWorld.
---
<header class="page-header wrap narrow">
  <p class="eyebrow">Devlog</p>
  <h1>Notes from the making of a world</h1>
  <p class="lede">Progress updates, design decisions, and the odd story the simulation tells by itself. <a href="/feed/">RSS feed</a></p>
</header>

<section class="wrap narrow">
  <div class="post-list stacked">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-card panel" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <p class="eyebrow"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
      <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      {% if post.data.summary %}<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </a>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="muted">The first post is on its way.</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
